        <div class="guarantee-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="guarantee-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Zero Advance Deposit on Transfers</h3>
          <p>Reserve your private minivan with live flight delay tracking. Zero prepayment needed — pay your driver directly upon hotel arrival (USD, EUR, or TZS cash or card).</p>
          <div class="guarantee-proof"><span>✓</span> 60 min complimentary airport delay waiting time</div>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card reveal delay-2">
          <div class="guarantee-icon">🌊</div>
          <h3>100% Captain's Weather Guarantee</h3>
          <p>Indian Ocean swells and weather can shift. If Zanzibar Maritime Authority advisories prevent safe sailing on your tour date, receive an immediate 100% refund or priority reschedule.</p>
          <div class="guarantee-proof"><span>✓</span> 100% refund or free date change</div>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card reveal delay-3">
          <div class="guarantee-icon">💎</div>
          <h3>Official Marine Fees Included</h3>
          <p>Zero beach tout surprises. Official government conservation fees ($25/adult Mnemba Atoll, $10/adult Menai Bay Safari Blue) are factored into all our quotes.</p>
          <div class="guarantee-proof"><span>✓</span> Complete transparency — no surprise cash on beach</div>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card reveal delay-4">
          <div class="guarantee-icon">🗣️</div>
          <h3>Dedicated Multilingual Guides</h3>
