          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/stone-town/">Stone Town</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">UNESCO Heritage • History • Culture • Food</p>
            <p>Historic heart — carved doors, Sultan's Palace, Anglican Cathedral (former slave market), Forodhani food market.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
                <img src="{{ 'kiwengwa-beach-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'kiwengwa-beach-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3><a href="/areas/kiwengwa/">Kiwengwa</a></h3>
            <p class="beach-vibe">All-Inclusive Resorts • Family-Friendly • Mnemba Access</p>
            <p>Northeast — long beach, family-friendly resorts, protected lagoon, easy boat access to Mnemba Atoll marine reserve.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="view-all reveal"><a href="/areas/" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore All 14 Areas →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Where to Stay Strip -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">{{ "nav_hotels_areas" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <h2>{{ "nav_hotels" | t(lang) }}</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">{{ stats.total_hotels }} curated properties across Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, Stone Town, Kiwengwa, Matemwe &amp; more — starting with our contracted partner stays with verified public rates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid cards-grid--4">
        {% for hotel in featuredPartnerHotels | limit(4) %}
          <article class="card reveal" data-category="HTL">
            <div class="card-image">
              <img src="{{ hotel.photo | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ hotel.name }} in {{ hotel.area }}, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
              <span class="image-tag">{{ hotel.area }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-badge badge-luxury">{{ hotel.board }}</span>
              <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/hotels/{{ hotel.pageSlug }}/">{{ hotel.name }}</a></h3>
              <p class="card-meta">{{ hotel.area }} • Verified Partner Rates</p>
              <p class="card-description">{{ hotel.summary | truncate(120) }}</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                {% if hotel.fromRate > 0 %}
                  <span class="card-price">From ${{ hotel.fromRate }} <span class="price-basis">{{ hotel.rateUnit }}</span></span>
                {% else %}
                  <span class="card-price">Seasonal Rates <span class="price-basis">confirmed by team</span></span>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="card-actions">
                  <a href="/hotels/{{ hotel.pageSlug }}/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Rates</a>
                  <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail!%20I%20would%20like%20details%20and%20rates%20for%20{{ hotel.name | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sns-card-whatsapp" data-trip-whatsapp aria-label="Ask on WhatsApp about {{ hotel.name }}">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="view-all reveal"><a href="/hotels/" class="btn btn-secondary">View All {{ stats.total_hotels }} Hotels &amp; Resorts →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Verified Standards & Direct Channels -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Verified Operations</span>
        <h2>Transparent Standards, Real Local Accountability</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Every rate, fee, and transfer quote on this site traces back to contracted Zanzibari partners and published conservation tariffs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-standards-grid">
        <article class="trust-standard-card reveal delay-1">
          <div class="trust-standard-kicker">Contracted Partner Rates</div>
          <h3>Published Hotel &amp; Excursion Tariffs</h3>
          <p>Partner hotel pages list our exact net-plus-margin and contracted rack discounts alongside city levy rules — no dynamic checkout markups.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="trust-standard-card reveal delay-2">
          <div class="trust-standard-kicker">Marine Fees Included</div>
          <h3>Menai Bay &amp; Mnemba Disclosed Upfront</h3>
          <p>Government marine park fees ($10/adult Menai Bay, $25/adult Mnemba Atoll) are built into quoted sea tours rather than demanded unexpectedly on the beach.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="trust-standard-card reveal delay-3">
          <div class="trust-standard-kicker">Mbuzini Operations Desk</div>
          <h3>Human Confirmation Before You Pay</h3>
          <p>Our local desk ({{ site.hours.days }}, {{ site.hours.open }}–{{ site.hours.close }} EAT) confirms availability and driver details directly on WhatsApp with zero transfer prepayment.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="view-all trust-profile-links reveal">
        {% if site.social.google_maps %}
        <a href="{{ site.social.google_maps }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">Verify Us on Google Maps ↗</a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if site.social.trustpilot %}
        <a href="{{ site.social.trustpilot }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Read &amp; Leave Reviews on Trustpilot ↗</a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "reviews-list.njk" %}

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Plan Your Trip</span>
        <h2>Popular Zanzibar Itineraries</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Ready-made plans based on what travellers search for — from weekend getaways to week-long adventures.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="card reveal" data-category="PKG">
          <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
                <img src="{{ 'stone-town-ornate-carved-door-calligraphy.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Zanzibar Essentials package — carved wooden door in Stone Town" loading="lazy">
            <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">Package</span>
            <div class="itinerary-days">3 Days</div>
            <h3 class="card-title"><a href="/packages/zanzibar-essentials-3day/">Zanzibar Essentials 3-Day</a></h3>
            <p class="card-description">Airport transfers + Stone Town tour + Safari Blue + Spice farm. Our signature intro package.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">$185–$260 <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
              <a href="/packages/zanzibar-essentials-3day/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Itinerary</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" data-category="PKG">
          <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
                <img src="{{ 'dhow-boat-turquoise-water-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Beach & Culture Combo — traditional wooden boat on turquoise water" loading="lazy">
            <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-package">Package</span>
            <div class="itinerary-days">4–5 Days</div>
            <h3 class="card-title">Beach & Culture Combo</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Stone Town (1 night) + Nungwi/Kendwa (2 nights) + Spice tour + Mnemba snorkeling + sunset cruise.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">Custom quote</span>
              <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=I'd%20like%20a%204-5%20day%20Zanzibar%20itinerary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Request Quote</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="card reveal" data-category="SAF">
          <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
                <img src="{{ 'serengeti-3-day-fly-in-safari-from-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="Ultimate Zanzibar + Safari — mainland Tanzania safari" loading="lazy">
            <button class="card-favorite" aria-label="Add to favorites">♡</button>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-safari">Safari</span>
            <div class="itinerary-days">7 Days</div>
            <h3 class="card-title">Ultimate Zanzibar + Safari</h3>
            <p class="card-description">Zanzibar highlights (4 nights) + Mikumi/Nyerere fly-in day safari or Serengeti 3-day fly-in.</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <span class="card-price">From $900 <span class="price-basis">per person</span></span>
              <a href="/safaris/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">View Safaris</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- FAQPage Schema JSON-LD -->
      <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {% for faq in travelguide.faqs %}
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": {{ faq.question | json | safe }},
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": {{ faq.answer | strip_html | json | safe }}
            }
          }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        ]
      }
      </script>
      
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Zanzibar Travel FAQs</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Quick answers to the questions travellers ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-grid">
        {% for faq in travelguide.faqs %}
        <details class="faq-item reveal">
          <summary class="faq-question">{{ faq.question }}</summary>
          <p class="faq-answer">{{ faq.answer }}</p>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Ready to Experience Zanzibar?</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp with your dates and interests. We'll send a personalized itinerary with transparent pricing within 24 hours.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=I'd%20like%20to%20plan%20my%20Zanzibar%20trip" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Plan My Trip on WhatsApp</a>
        <a href="/tours/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Browse Tours First</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

